cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use reach-gap, please cite this software release."
title: "reach-gap: evidence-aware spatial modelling of antibody accessibility"
version: 0.8.0
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Rafael
    family-names: Soler Ortuño
license: MIT
date-released: 2026-08-05
repository-code: "https://github.com/rsolerortuno/reach-gap"
url: "https://github.com/rsolerortuno/reach-gap"
abstract: >-
  reach-gap connects spatial tissue measurements, simplified antibody-transport modelling,
  uncertainty propagation and an auditable evidence graph. It reports relative target-accessibility
  evidence when supported and explicitly abstains from absolute claims when required same-tissue
  measurements are missing.
keywords:
  - spatial biology
  - antibody therapeutics
  - tumour microenvironment
  - uncertainty quantification
  - Xenium
